  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Lifesaving Assistance for Conflict-affected HHS with Humanitarian Coordination and Localization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to address lifesaving humanitarian needs and improve resilience of most vulnerable idps and host communities in mafa and konduga by increasing access to integrated, disability-inclusive and gender-sensitive food assistance (cash and vouchers) nutrition, livelihoods, wash, and protection services, while reducing challenges to humanitarian action with localization. the total number of beneficiaries that will be supported under this award is 270,045.</narrative>
  </description>
